title = SNCF Class CC 72100
description = The SNCF Class CC 72100 is a class of C′C′ diesel-electric locomotives rebuilt from CC 72000 locomotives during 2002–2004. 30 locomotives were converted. They find use on the Paris - Mulhouse line and are based at Chalindrey. The CC 72100 class locomotives were withdrawn from service on August 28, 2017, and replaced by the newer Coradia Liner B 85000.
